name: sim.setSphericalJointMatrix
description: 
luaSynopsis: sim.setSphericalJointMatrix(int objectHandle,float[12] matrix)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. objectHandle: handle of the joint object
2. matrix: pointer to 12 double values (the last row of the 4x4 matrix (0,0,0,1) is not needed)
3. The x-axis of the orientation component is (matrix[0],matrix[4],matrix[8])
4. The y-axis of the orientation component is (matrix[1],matrix[5],matrix[9])
5. The z-axis of the orientation component is (matrix[2],matrix[6],matrix[10])
6. The translation component is (matrix[3],matrix[7],matrix[11]) (the translational components will be ignored)
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
